    "Active accounts means account_status='active'; trials are excluded.",
    "MRR is the sum of monthly_contract_value_inr for active accounts, not invoice revenue or cash.",
    "Billed revenue includes paid and open invoices and excludes void invoices.",
    "Cash collected is paid_amount_inr for paid invoices only.",
    "Overdue receivables are open invoices due before 2026-10-01.",
    "Churn rate is churned accounts divided by all accounts.",
    "Collection rate is paid cash divided by the face value of paid plus open invoices.",
    "Unresolved tickets have status open or in_progress.",
    "All INR amounts are illustrative synthetic values."
